From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:55:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Scan every drive for PS4 games without asking for a
 folder

File > Scan for PS4 games searches all local and removable drives at once, one thread
per drive, with a cancel button. The Windows folder, the recycle bin and the other
system folders are skipped, a game folder is not searched any further and update
folders are ignored. The folders that hold the games found are added to the library.
